      "source": "If the underlying XSLT engine is Xalan, then the special output key <code>indent-amount</code>\nwill be also be set to a value of <a href=\"#DEFAULT_INDENT_AMOUNT\"><code>DEFAULT_INDENT_AMOUNT</code></a> characters.",
      "translation": "如果底层 XSLT 引擎是 Xalan，则特殊输出键 `<code>indent-amount</code>` 也将被设置为 `<a href=\"#DEFAULT_INDENT_AMOUNT\"><code>DEFAULT_INDENT_AMOUNT</code></a>` 个字符的值。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>transformer</code> - the target transformer",
      "translation": "<code>transformer</code> - 目标转换器",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Defaults to \"2\".",
      "translation": "默认为\"2\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The indent amount of characters if <a href=\"#enableIndenting(javax.xml.transform.Transformer)\"><code>indenting is enabled</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果启用了<a href=\"#enableIndenting(javax.xml.transform.Transformer)\"><code>缩进</code></a>，则字符的缩进量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable indenting for the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/transform/Transformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.transform\"><code>Transformer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "禁用为提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/transform/Transformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.transform\"><code>Transformer</code></a>设置的缩进。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enable indenting for the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/transform/Transformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.transform\"><code>Transformer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "启用为提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/javax/xml/transform/Transformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.xml.transform\"><code>Transformer</code></a>设置的缩进。",
      "count": 2
